<title>USA: N.Y. Environmental Corp $78 mln yields raised.</title>
<headline>N.Y. Environmental Corp $78 mln yields raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Wednesday it repriced and restructured N.Y. Environmental Facilities Corporation's $78 million bond deal, raising yields on the long end and adding a 2017 maturity.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
